Test fixtures for CoreTests
===========================

cputest-basic.sfc
  "65C816 TEST" from gilyon/snes-tests, release v1.4
  Source:  https://github.com/gilyon/snes-tests/releases/download/v1.4/snes-tests.zip
           (file cputest/cputest-basic.sfc in that archive)
  License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 gilyon. Redistribution is permitted; full text below.
  SHA-256: d479bde706b9e16d76c0dfe98e2b2d3f5348f9dcb911e6a36b898f4201fc98bb

cputest-deflate.zip, cputest-stored.zip
  The same ROM zipped with `zip -9` (deflate) and `zip -0` (stored), to exercise the
  .zip loader. Same license.

The SRAM test patches a copy of the ROM header at runtime (cartridge type 0x02, 8 KB RAM)
so the core allocates battery RAM; no patched ROM is stored here.

240pee.nes
  "240p Test Suite" (NES) by Damian Yerrick, release v0.23
  Source:  https://github.com/pinobatch/240p-test-mini/releases/download/v0.23/240pee.nes
           (source code: https://github.com/pinobatch/240p-test-mini)
  License: GPL-2.0 (see the LICENSE file in that repository). Redistributed unmodified
           for testing; source is available at the URL above.
  SHA-256: 04f01d7372f66ea2befe325b9bd655a9fcc395a31fa46d9466286bb8f9d2e62e

240pee.zip
  The same NES ROM zipped with `zip -9`, to exercise system detection inside archives.

